@DrJoelGator It’s the grind that creates good judgement.  

Good judgement comes with time. 

Looking back, although it was painful, the residency hours (100+/week) were well worth it.

@SewerGasMan @GiaMMacool Agree. 

However, husbands will go through times where they are weak, unstable, and unlovable. 

That’s when he needs his wife the most.

@engineer_JoshTx @GiaMMacool True, but disrespect often starts when the man loves other things more than his wife. 

For me, that was my work… 

I still love my work, but create boundaries to make sure I’m spending time with my family.
